# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# No data goes in here: neither yours nor your clients'. The repository
# holds the program only. The database, the invoices, the bank statements
# and the backups stay on your own Mac.
# Clients' names, addresses and emails are third-party data: handing them
# out is not an oversight, it is a legal problem (FADP in Switzerland,
# GDPR in the EU).
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Python environment (rebuilt by itself on first start) ---
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# --- macOS clutter ---
.DS_Store

# --- the DATA: database, session register, cache, logs, backups ---
data/
sessions.json
sessions_seed.json

# --- the DOCUMENTS: invoices, exports, bank statements, trash ---
Invoices/
Exports/
Trash/
Bank statements/*
!Bank statements/README.txt

# The Italian names these folders had before. They stay listed so that a
# copy still in the middle of the rename never publishes anything either.
Fatture/
Esporti/
Cestino/
Estratti conto/

# --- the WORKING NOTES: they are minutes of decisions taken on real data,
# full of client names and amounts. They are for whoever built this app,
# not for whoever uses it: the documentation for users is the README.
SPEC-crediti.md
docs/
